 "remarks": "BEST & FINAL offer deadline is Tuesday, September 8th at 1pm***An original-owner unit with plenty of potential! This 2-bedroom, 1.5-bath end-unit townhouse offers 896 square feet, a bonus room in the lower level, garage, and the chance to make it your own. Yes, it needs work-but that's why it's priced this way. Bring your ideas and create a home that reflects your style while building value along the way. Tucked into a quiet complex, residents enjoy an in-ground pool just steps from your front door. The end-unit location offers an added sense of privacy, while the garage and lower-level bonus space are the kind of extras that make this opportunity stand out. Conveniently located near Oak Hills Park with its public 18-hole golf course, walking trails and tennis courts, plus Kendall Elementary School, Odeen's Restaurant, shopping and major commuting routes.  Whether you're looking for a home to transform or an investment opportunity, there's a lot to work with here. Estate sale. Administrator has never occupied the property and has no knowledge of the unit's condition or history. Sold as-is, where-is.  ASSOCIATION INFO: 2 pets permitted. Rentals capped at 12 units (7 currently rented). Minimum 1-year lease. No move-in/out fees. No special assessments.***As a bonus, the old carpeting has already been removed! One less project to tackle as you bring your vision to life. FLOOR PLANS INCLUDED IN THE PHOTOS SECTION.",
